      N_s >= |S1|^2/(S2+Delta) and N_0^s >= 2|S1|^2/(S2+E_off) - N hold identically.
  Degree-2 holomorphic pairings on a mirror pair: on-line positivity forces
  Q(a,c)=2alpha Re(a conj c)+2beta Re(a^2-c^2); then Q(a,-a) = -2 alpha|a|^2 < 0.  (algebraic)

